                    <a href="#join" class="cb-btn" style="width:auto;padding:.85rem 2rem;text-decoration:none;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;border-radius:12px;">
                        Join the Rebuild Network <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
                    </a>
                    <a href="#mission" class="btn" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);color:#CBD5E1;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:12px;padding:.85rem 1.5rem;font-weight:600;">
                        Read the Protocol
