                Here is how we bounce back.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="row g-4">
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="pillar-card orange h-100">
                    <div class="pillar-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-tower-broadcast"></i></div>
                    <h4 class="text-white mb-3">Off-Platform Networks</h4>
                    <p class="text-muted-cb" style="line-height:1.7;">
                        Social media platforms profit from outrage and division. We build custom, dedicated
                        forums and tools to bypass the algorithm entirely — keeping builders connected on
                        infrastructure we control.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="pillar-card green h-100">
                    <div class="pillar-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-check"></i></div>
                    <h4 class="text-white mb-3">Digital &amp; IRL Coordination</h4>
                    <p class="text-muted-cb" style="line-height:1.7;">
                        Code is great, but physical networks are unbreakable. Our tools focus on localized
                        event scheduling, work parties, and real-world assembly of civic builders — because
                        community is built in person.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="pillar-card blue h-100">
                    <div class="pillar-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-radio"></i></div>
                    <h4 class="text-white mb-3">CB &amp; HAM Radio Ethos</h4>
                    <p class="text-muted-cb" style="line-height:1.7;">
                        Decentralized, redundant, and resilient. Operating adjacent to official emergency
